    <title class="- topic/title "><ph class="- topic/ph topic/title-wrapper ">How to Start the Calculator?</ph></title>
    <shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Here, you will learn how to start the calculator..</shortdesc>
    <taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody ">
        <prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq " id="unique_1_Connect_42_prereq_oxh_lyl_dkc" nd:nd-id="prereq_oxh_lyl_dkc">
            <p class="- topic/p ">To use the calculator app, you need to unlock your phone first.</p>
        </prereq>
        <context class="- topic/section task/context ">
            <p class="- topic/p ">You can use a calculator app on your smartphone. You will find it useful, when you
                need to quickly calculate some numbers.</p>
        </context>
        <steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step class="- topic/li task/step ">
                <cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to the <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">Calculator application </b>icon.</cmd>
            </step><step class="- topic/li task/step ">
                <cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Tap the icon.</cmd>
            </step></steps>
        <result class="- topic/section task/result " id="unique_1_Connect_42_result_trn_nyl_dkc" nd:nd-id="result_trn_nyl_dkc">
            <p class="- topic/p ">The application starts.</p>
            <p class="- topic/p ">You are now ready to calculate with it.</p>
        </result>
        <example class="- topic/example " id="unique_1_Connect_42_example_uqt_4yl_dkc" nd:nd-id="example_uqt_4yl_dkc">For example, if you have purchased a book for $5 and you
            have given $10, how much change should you expect? <p class="- topic/p ">The answer is 10-5 = $5
                change.</p></example>
    </taskbody>
</task></map>